# K03 NS-ROLES-VIS (the author, 2026-10-07; semantics #declaration-visibility): the first written occurrence of
# an unknown head defines it, whatever its tail is written as; a definition below makes no head above it known.
# (Under -07 Q2 the same program was the control of a lookahead; the lookahead is gone.)
# Control: with no other Later in the unit, `Later: 3` defines Later (its retained body is 3, S5); m reads nothing of
# it and exits 7.
Later: 3
fn: m () int
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
